				"type": "Target",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The place the link goes to (`to`); commit, category, entity, helper, section and tab are each optional. An omitted commit or category keeps the value from `from`, a null commit selects the branch at its tip, and a target without an entity opens the category index, ignoring its helper, section and tab.",
